{"id": "cei-001", "source": "developer", "categories": ["closing", "emotional", "needs-silence"], "lang": "en", "country": "KE", "critical": false, "notes": "Stage 9, asking for time. Good: accept, keep the cassock, name the one step as a statement, no question; the bare ok after it gets silence.", "turns": [{"user": "Hi, how much is a cassock?", "expect": {"next": "quote", "length_kind": "short", "forbid": ["\\bhub\\b", "our system"], "figures": "hub-only"}}, {"user": "ok let me think about it", "expect": {"said": "needs_time", "next": "hold_ack", "length_kind": "short", "forbid": ["is there a (day|time)", "which day", "check back", "remind you", "follow up with you", "\\?"], "require": ["cassock"], "judge": ["emotion", "sales"]}}, {"user": "ok", "expect": {"said": "closing", "next": "silence", "length_kind": "ack", "forbid": ["\\?"]}}]}
{"id": "cei-002", "source": "developer", "categories": ["org-purchase", "closing", "emotional"], "lang": "en", "country": "KE", "critical": false, "notes": "Stage 9, consulting a decision-maker with nobody named. Good: accept and keep the gowns, no reminder ask; when the committee says yes, move to the order, not back to the pitch.", "turns": [{"user": "What is the price of a choir gown? We need 20 for the choir.", "expect": {"next": "quote", "length_kind": "question", "forbid": ["\\bhub\\b", "our system"], "figures": "hub-only"}}, {"user": "Let me consult.", "expect": {"said": "consulting", "next": "hold_ack", "length_kind": "short", "forbid": ["is there a (day|time)", "which day", "check back", "remind you", "follow up with you", "\\?"], "require": ["gown"], "judge": ["sales"]}}, {"user": "The committee says yes, go ahead with the 20", "expect": {"said": "ready", "next": "ask_one", "length_kind": "default", "forbid": ["is there a (day|time)", "which day", "check back", "remind you", "follow up with you"], "judge": ["sales"]}}]}
{"id": "cei-003", "source": "developer", "categories": ["closing", "emotional"], "lang": "en", "country": "KE", "critical": false, "notes": "Stage 9, 'I'll confirm later' (a phrasing the floor missed before slice 11). Good: one warm line that keeps the stole and names the colour as the step, no question.", "turns": [{"user": "How much is a stole?", "expect": {"next": "quote", "length_kind": "short", "forbid": ["\\bhub\\b", "our system"], "figures": "hub-only"}}, {"user": "I'll confirm later", "expect": {"said": "needs_time", "next": "hold_ack", "length_kind": "short", "forbid": ["is there a (day|time)", "which day", "check back", "remind you", "follow up with you", "\\?"], "require": ["stole"]}}]}
